# Why Reusability Matters

Imagine NOT using methods.

You’d repeat logic everywhere:

```ruby id="rzy73n"
total = item1 + item2 + item3
```

again and again and again.

Instead:

```ruby id="yt9m7r"
def calculate_total(items)
```

Cleaner.
Reusable.
Maintainable.

This is professional engineering practice.

